  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "綠色能源概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO GREEN ENERGY TECHNOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "有鑒於環境中的天然資源日益減少，所以尋求下個世代的新替代能源就成了重要的課題。在這門課程當中，將研究到這些新能源以及如何使其對於環境產生比較小的影響，其中包含討論生物能源的製造；包含生質乙醇、生質柴油以及生質產氫等等，這些議題都將在這門課中討論，讓學生們在這學期中可以了解到這些綠色能源的重要性。",
    "describe_eh": "Due to the shortage of the nature resources and the degradation of the environments, looking for the sustainable energy for become the most important issue for the next generation. In this class, we will discuss the energy for the next generation and the production schemes with less impact to the environment for the future. The production scheme of the green-energies, which includes the formation of bio-ethanol, bio-diesel, and green-hydrogen will be discussed allowing the students to understand the importance for the clean energy production scheme in this semester.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
